  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electromagnetic wave travels from medium 1 to medium 2. The wavelength of the wave in medium 1 is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{1}\"></span>. The wavelength of the wave in medium 2 is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{2}\"></span>. The refractive index of medium 1 is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the refractive index of medium 2?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda_{1}n}{\\lambda_{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda_{2}n}{\\lambda_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda_{2}}{\\lambda_{1}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda_{1}}{\\lambda_{2}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
